      en: ["Provincial capital of North-Western Zambia.", "Home to the massive Kansanshi Copper and Gold Mine.", "One of the fastest-growing cities in Zambia.", "Site of the prehistoric Kifubwa Rock carvings.", "Economic engine of the region's mining industry.", "Key logistics hub for mineral exports."],
